        "defaultPrompt": [
          "\u05d4\u05e6\u05d2 \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05d7\u05d9\u05d1\u05d5\u05e8\u05d9\u05dd \u05e9\u05dc\u05d9 \u05d5\u05e2\u05d6\u05d5\u05e8 \u05dc\u05d9 \u05dc\u05d4\u05ea\u05d7\u05d9\u05dc \u05e2\u05dd \u05e0\u05ea\u05d5\u05e0\u05d9 \u05d4\u05e8\u05db\u05d1 \u05d5\u05d4\u05ea\u05d7\u05d1\u05d5\u05e8\u05d4 \u05e9\u05dc\u05d9.",
          "Show my connected software and the vehicle, fleet or parts data I can explore.",
          "\u05e2\u05d6\u05d5\u05e8 \u05dc\u05d9 \u05dc\u05de\u05e6\u05d5\u05d0 \u05de\u05d9\u05d3\u05e2 \u05e2\u05dc \u05e8\u05db\u05d1\u05d9\u05dd, \u05d0\u05d5\u05e4\u05e0\u05d5\u05e2\u05d9\u05dd, \u05de\u05e9\u05d0\u05d9\u05d5\u05ea \u05d5\u05db\u05d1\u05d9\u05e9\u05d9\u05dd \u05d1\u05de\u05e7\u05d5\u05e8\u05d5\u05ea \u05d4\u05d6\u05de\u05d9\u05e0\u05d9\u05dd \u05dc\u05d9."
        ],
        "developerName": "NAVINES ISRAEL LTD",
        "displayName": "TalkToData Automotive",
        "logo": "assets/brand-mark.png",
        "logoDark": "assets/brand-mark.png",
        "longDescription": "Turn transport data into a conversation with TalkToData Automotive \u2014 part of the TalkToData family by NAVINES ISRAEL LTD.\n\nBuilt for people working across cars, motorcycles, scooters, trucks, buses, fleets, workshops, vehicle appraisal, claims, parts, towing and roadside services. Ask in English or Hebrew, explore your authorized connections and turn records into clear answers.\n\nDiscover vehicle and fleet lists, motorcycle and powersports parts, OEM cross-references, VIN specifications, Israeli public transport datasets, road traffic and route estimates. Use a bilingual portal to select your software, connect securely and find the data that matters to your work.\n\nExplore our transport software and services directory: Motive, Fleetio, Samsara, Shopmonkey, AutoWiz, WPS, Geotab, TomTom, HERE, Israel Ministry of Transport, NHTSA vPIC, TfL, MBTA, MRM Horizon / Auto3P, DataCar, Musachit 2020, Nesher, Eit / Della, OmdanOS, Torque, GetAuto, Eitan Plus, managerWEB, Gsher, Smart Garage, Garage OS, Agero / Swoop, Dispatch Anywhere, Towbook, TowSoft. The directory also features product families such as MultiCat, Shamayit 2000, Dcwin, DCL, Audatex, Rishui 2020, Nes2Go, Nes4You, VHC, Barak CRM, Barak2Go, Madaf, Torque Pro and the GetAuto suite.\n\nFrom everyday vehicle questions to a broader view of your operations, keep the conversation connected to its source. Get read-only insights through your authorized connections and public sources, with clear source context and human support for your next step.\n\nTalkToData Automotive is an independent NAVINES ISRAEL LTD product. Product names identify their respective software and services.",
        "privacyPolicyURL": "https://talktodata.navines.com/privacy",
